@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

title Vision Feature - Component Diagram

package "Vision API Layer" {
  [FastAPI App\nsrc/api.py] as API
  [Session Manager\n(session lifecycle + paths)] as Session
  [Frame Queue / Worker\n(async processing queues)] as Queue
}

package "Vision Processing Pipeline" {
  [Capture Module\nsrc/capture/webcam_capture.py] as Capture
  [Preprocessing\nsrc/preprocessing/preprocess.py] as Preprocess
  [UI Detector\nsrc/vision/detector.py] as Detector
  [BBox Refiner\nsrc/perception/grounding/bbox_refiner.py] as Refiner
  [Element Enricher\nsrc/perception/grounding/bbox_element_enricher.py] as Enricher
  [Semantic/VLM Layer\nsrc/perception/vlm/*] as VLM
  [Session Aggregator\nsrc/session_aggregator.py] as Aggregator
}

package "Vision Storage" {
  [raw_frames/] as Raw
  [preprocessed_frames/] as Prep
  [coarse_bboxes/] as Coarse
  [refined_bboxes/] as Refined
  [final_elements/] as Final
}

API --> Session : create/update session
API --> Capture : acquire frames
Capture --> Raw : save changed frames

API --> Queue : enqueue frame jobs
Queue --> Preprocess : normalize frames
Preprocess --> Prep : write output

Prep --> Detector : detect UI elements
Detector --> Coarse : save coarse detections

Coarse --> Refiner : refine boxes
Refiner --> Refined : save refined boxes

Refined --> Enricher : enrich metadata
Enricher --> VLM : semantic labeling
VLM --> Final : save final elements JSON

Final --> Aggregator : aggregate per-session state
Aggregator --> API : return response payload

@enduml